---@class gcp.unstable.merchantapi_products_v1.ListAccountsProductsRequest
---@field pageToken? string A page token, received from a previous `ListProducts` call. Provide this to retrieve the subsequent page. When paginating, all other parameters provided to `ListProducts` must match the call that provided the page token.
---@field parent string Required. The account to list processed products for. Format: `accounts/{account}`
---@field pageSize? number The maximum number of products to return. The service may return fewer than this value. The maximum value is 1000; values above 1000 will be coerced to 1000. If unspecified, the default page size of 25 products will be returned.

