---@field customLabel2? string [Custom label 2](https://support.google.com/merchants/answer/6324473) for custom grouping of items in a Shopping campaign.
---@field customLabel3? string [Custom label 3](https://support.google.com/merchants/answer/6324473) for custom grouping of items in a Shopping campaign.
---@field linkTemplate? string [Link template](https://support.google.com/merchants/answer/13871172) for business hosted local storefront.
---@field maxEnergyEfficiencyClass? gcp.unstable.merchantapi_products_v1.ProductAttributesMaxEnergyEfficiencyClassEnum|string The [energy efficiency class](https://support.google.com/merchants/answer/7562785) as defined in EU directive 2010/30/EU.
---@field leaseTerm? gcp.unstable.merchantapi_products_v1.LeaseTerm The lease term of the property.
---@field certifiedPreOwned? boolean Whether the vehicle is OEM [certified pre-owned](https://support.google.com/google-ads/answer/14156475).
---@field availabilityDate? string The day a pre-ordered product becomes available for delivery, in [ISO 8601](http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/ISO_8601) format.
