---@field mileage? gcp.unstable.merchantapi_products_v1.Mileage The number of miles/kms on the vehicle. See the [Mileage](https://support.google.com/google-ads/answer/14156166) for more information.
---@field customLabel0? string [Custom label 0](https://support.google.com/merchants/answer/6324473) for custom grouping of items in a Shopping campaign.
---@field gtins? gcp.unstable.merchantapi_products_v1.StringList Global Trade Item Numbers ([GTIN](https://support.google.com/merchants/answer/6324461)) of the item. You can provide up to 10 GTINs.
---@field title? string Title of the item.
