---The product details.
---@class gcp.unstable.merchantapi_products_v1.ProductDetail
---@field sectionName? string The section header used to group a set of product details.
---@field attributeValue? string The value of the product detail.
---@field attributeName? string The name of the product detail.

---@alias gcp.unstable.merchantapi_products_v1.ProductDetailList gcp.unstable.merchantapi_products_v1.ProductDetail[]

---The dimension of the product.
---@class gcp.unstable.merchantapi_products_v1.ProductDimension
---@field unit? string Required. The dimension units. Acceptable values are: * "`in`" * "`cm`"
---@field value? number Required. The dimension value represented as a number. The value can have a maximum precision of four decimal places.

---The product fee attribute containing type and amount.
---@class gcp.unstable.merchantapi_products_v1.ProductFee
---@field amount? gcp.unstable.merchantapi_products_v1.Price The amount of product fee.
---@field type? gcp.unstable.merchantapi_products_v1.ProductFeeTypeEnum|string The type of product fee.

