---@field country? string The [CLDR territory code](http://www.unicode.org/repos/cldr/tags/latest/common/main/en.xml) of the country to which an item will ship.

---@alias gcp.unstable.merchantapi_products_v1.ShippingBusinessDaysConfigList gcp.unstable.merchantapi_products_v1.ShippingBusinessDaysConfig[]

